A||||3||Gokart||Locked my Dad in my GT!||||11||
Z||000000||Gokart||01-25-2000||07:49 PM||||My Dad stopped over last night and I just had to have him hear the new "12 dual voice coil woofer that I put in my bass box that sits on the passengers side floor. Found a tape by the Cars and popped it in, he sat in and said "sounds great". I said, ya but listen to it with the door shut, so I shut it not knowing the doors we're locked!! I had it cranked so loud he couldn't hear me telling him to push the power door lock button! I ran in the house and couldn't find my spare set, ran back out with a flashlight (2 songs later) and tryed telling him again to PUSH THE BUTTON! He kept trying to open the door from the handle and I was worried that he was going to break it off, so I finally got my tools (another 2 songs later) and dissconnected the neg bat terminal! Then he could at least hear me when I flashed the light on the door and got him to slide the lock over so he could finally get out! He's 67 and already half deaf. I think I took care of the other half and he won't be coming to see me for a while! He's just lucky that I put in something I knew he could tolerate and not my new 311 or NIN tape!||||reg||11
